description "SpecForce Marine

Battle-hardened Rebels sporting low-gravity suits and intimidating weapons.

^2Weaponry:
- 0-G Melee
-- Lifts on hit
-- 25% more damage
-- 13% slower RoF
-- Heavyweight
- Frag Grenade (1)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Getup (1)
- Resource Regen: 25/.5s
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Slow Faller
- Dexterity (3)
- Blast Armor
- Beskar (3)
- Climate Shielding (1)
- 8% more knockback given

^3Abilities:
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]"